  vendorName: Jeweler Baxter
  offerText: Hide this heavy, locked iron safe for me tonight! I cannot offer you
    coin right now, and it requires immense space, but my future gratitude will be
    boundless.
  acceptResultText: You agree to hide the safe. The massive iron block cramps your
    room, and you spend the hour sweating, terrified that ruthless thieves will break
    in.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to involve yourself in shady business. You sleep peacefully,
    completely free of criminal anxiety.
  acceptedDelayedText: Baxter returns safely! As a reward for your absolute loyalty,
    he cracks the safe and hands you a handful of flawless, uncut diamonds!
